mapper.body:
**PR auditor** — an automated review by `claude-sonnet-5`, posted through a token scoped to comment and nothing else. It cannot approve, merge, label or block, and it is not a required check. Treat it as one reviewer's opinion, read against the diff.
{{if(3.data.stop_reason = "end_turn"; ""; newline + "> ⚠️ **This review is incomplete — it was cut off, not finished.** The model stopped with `stop_reason: " + 3.data.stop_reason + "` rather than `end_turn`, so anything below the cut-off is missing and the findings are not exhaustive." + newline)}}
---

{{join(map(3.data.content; "text"; "type"; "text"); newline)}}
